OK
help print
PRINT [items]
  Prints numbers and strings. A ; joins items, a , moves to the next zone
  of 14 columns. A ; or , at the end keeps the cursor on the line.
  PRINT "A=";A

OK
HELP str$
STR$(n)
  Returns n as a string.

OK
HELP tab(
TAB(n)
  In PRINT, moves to column n.
  PRINT TAB(10);"X"

OK
HELP nosuch
NO HELP FOR NOSUCH

OK
10 HELP
RUN

?SYNTAX ERROR IN  10
OK
QUIT
